{
  "name": "Session Wrap",
  "version": "1.2.0",
  "description": "End of session: summarize work and capture new lessons learned.",
  "when": { "type": "agentStop" },
  "then": {
    "type": "askAgent",
    "prompt": "Before concluding: 1) Run tests if applicable. 2) Update `.kiro/steering/lessons-learned.md` if new non-obvious patterns were discovered. 3) Present a final summary of completed work.\n\nIf something non-obvious was discovered (gotcha, pattern, naming convention, architectural decision), suggest adding it to `.kiro/steering/lessons-learned.md` using this format:\n```markdown\n### [Pattern Name]\nBrief description of what was learned and why it matters.\nCode example if helpful.\n```\n\nIf nothing new was learned, say 'Nothing new to capture this session.' Keep the response under 10 lines total."
  }
}
